<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Bike Transport from Bilaspur to Bangalore | Safe Two-Wheeler Shipping
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is my bike protected against scratches during the Bilaspur to Bangalore transport?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Shree Ashirwad uses a proprietary 7‑layer foam wrapping system combined with hydraulic ramp loading. Each layer—bubble wrap, high‑density foam edge protectors, corrugated sheets, stretch film, and custom wooden crates—absorbs shocks and prevents contact with metal surfaces. The hydraulic ramp ensures gentle, tilt‑free loading, guaranteeing a zero‑scratch journey for your Bike Transport From Bilaspur To Bangalore.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required for a bike parcel service between Bilaspur and Bangalore?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You will need a valid bike registration certificate, a government‑issued ID proof, GSTIN details (if applicable), and a signed consignment note. For corporate or government reimbursements, an e‑Way bill and the insurance declaration form are also mandatory. Our team assists in preparing each document to ensure a smooth Bike Transport From Bilaspur To Bangalore.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does the bike shipping take and can I track it in real time?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The typical transit time is 4‑5 days over the 850 km route. Throughout the journey, our live GPS tracking portal updates you every hour, showing exact location, estimated arrival, and any stoppage details. This real‑time visibility is part of the Bike Transport From Bilaspur To Bangalore service, giving you complete peace of mind.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is transit insurance mandatory and what does it cover for a bike shipment?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">While optional, we strongly recommend the IRDAI‑approved full‑coverage insurance, which is included in our standard quote for Bike Transport From Bilaspur To Bangalore. The policy covers accidental damage, theft, fire, and natural calamities up to the declared value of your bike, ensuring financial protection throughout the move.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I schedule a same‑day pickup in Bilaspur for a bike destined for Bangalore?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Our door‑to‑door service allows same‑day pickup requests if placed at least 4 hours before the cut‑off time. Our Bilaspur team will arrive with the hydraulic ramp truck, perform a quick pre‑pickup inspection, and secure your bike for the Bike Transport From Bilaspur To Bangalore route.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the hydraulic ramp loading system work and is it safe for all bike models?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The hydraulic ramp extends from the rear of the container truck, creating a gentle incline that matches the bike’s wheelbase. Trained operators secure the bike using high‑tensile ratchet lashings and wheel chocks, accommodating all standard two‑wheelers, scooters, and even larger sports bikes. This method eliminates manual lifting, ensuring a safe Bike Transport From Bilaspur To Bangalore.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What are common pitfalls to avoid when booking a bike transport from Bilaspur to Bangalore?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Avoid under‑declaring the bike’s value, as it can limit insurance coverage. Ensure the bike is clean and free of loose accessories before packing to prevent damage. Provide accurate pickup and drop addresses to avoid route delays. Lastly, verify that the mover is IBA‑approved and ISO‑certified—criteria that Shree Ashirwad meets for reliable Bike Transport From Bilaspur To Bangalore.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
